      "context_excerpt": "In the field of large language models, Megatron-LM was an applied research initiative that enabled the efficient training and inference of massive LLMs for language-based tasks such as content generation, translation and conversational AI. It’s integrated into the NVIDIA NeMo platform for developing custom generative AI, which also features speech recognition and speech synthesis models that originated in NVIDIA Research.",
